    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jimmy, captain of the deep-sea research vessel Trilobite, leads his crew\u2014including his younger brother, Jack\u2014to investigate an unidentified signal. But unlike previous missions, the newly assigned, enigmatic commander appears to have ulterior motives\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622450/extras/04db491f8c9857913bb4d82fdddd0d0c.poster.avif?t=1747811673\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622450/extras/04db491f8c9857913bb4d82fdddd0d0c.webm?t=1747811673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sea Blindness\u00a0</i>is a 2D pixel-art narrative RPG Game. In the year 2064, players assume the role of Jimmy, a deep-sea researcher who becomes entangled in a mysterious incident only to discover he's trapped inside a video game. Together with the player, Jimmy must navigate this digital realm to rescue his crewmates and ultimately restore balance to the game world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622450/extras/0e0a70fb6ada803c8a75792374b79f18.poster.avif?t=1747811673\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622450/extras/0e0a70fb6ada803c8a75792374b79f18.webm?t=1747811673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622450/extras/0e0a70fb6ada803c8a75792374b79f18.mp4?t=1747811673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Self-Aware NPCs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters gain consciousness and collaborate with players to complete problems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fourth-Wall-Breaking Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game dynamically generates special files on your local PC as part of the narrative experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive Controls\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple keyboard and mouse interactions drive progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Audio</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headphones recommended for full atmospheric impact.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622450/extras/eaefb37cf820b2c3d0ea0f239bebd3c1.poster.avif?t=1747811673\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622450/extras/eaefb37cf820b2c3d0ea0f239bebd3c1.webm?t=1747811673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622450/extras/eaefb37cf820b2c3d0ea0f239bebd3c1.mp4?t=1747811673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WASD:\u00a0</strong>Character movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>E:\u00a0</strong>Interact with objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse:\u00a0</strong>Click/Drag to interact with files and UI elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Z:</strong> Quit game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Detailed Instructions for Game File Panel Operations\uff1a</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the\u00a0<strong>Game File</strong>\u00a0icon with your mouse to open/close the Panel.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the\u00a0<strong>File</strong>\u00a0icon with your mouse to open the File.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold and drag the\u00a0<strong>File</strong>\u00a0icon to the desired folder to move its location.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">When the game notifies you of a new email message, why not check your computer desktop? ;)</span></strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jimmy, captain of the deep-sea research vessel Trilobite, leads his crew\u2014including his younger brother, Jack\u2014to investigate an unidentified signal. But unlike previous missions, the newly assigned, enigmatic commander appears to have ulterior motives\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622450/extras/04db491f8c9857913bb4d82fdddd0d0c.poster.avif?t=1747811673\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622450/extras/04db491f8c9857913bb4d82fdddd0d0c.webm?t=1747811673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sea Blindness\u00a0</i>is a 2D pixel-art narrative RPG Game. In the year 2064, players assume the role of Jimmy, a deep-sea researcher who becomes entangled in a mysterious incident only to discover he's trapped inside a video game. Together with the player, Jimmy must navigate this digital realm to rescue his crewmates and ultimately restore balance to the game world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622450/extras/0e0a70fb6ada803c8a75792374b79f18.poster.avif?t=1747811673\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622450/extras/0e0a70fb6ada803c8a75792374b79f18.webm?t=1747811673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622450/extras/0e0a70fb6ada803c8a75792374b79f18.mp4?t=1747811673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features: