trong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the\u00a0<strong>Game File</strong>\u00a0icon with your mouse to open/close the Panel.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the\u00a0<strong>File</strong>\u00a0icon with your mouse to open the File.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold and drag the\u00a0<strong>File</strong>\u00a0icon to the desired folder to move its location.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">When the game notifies you of a new email message, why not check your computer desktop? ;)</span></strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
